#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:5
msgid "Save title block"
msgstr "保存图框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:7
msgid ""
"The current `title block`_ can be saved from `menu bar`_, `toolbar`_ and "
"using the corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"当前的 `图框 <title block_>`_ 可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_，`工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ "
"中保存，并使用相应的键盘快捷键。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:10
msgid ""
"One `title block`_ is conformed by only one file with the format "
"``.titleblock``. The ``.titleblock`` extension is the native extension from "
"QElectroTech `title blocks`_."
msgstr ""
"1 `图框 <title block_>`_ 只有一个文件符合格式 ``.titleblock`` 。 ``.titleblock`` 扩展是 "
"QElectroTech `图框 <title blocks_>`_ 的本地扩展 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:14
msgid "Save title block from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏中保存图框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:16
msgid "Select **File > Save** menu item to save the `title block`_ changes."
msgstr "选择 **文件 > 保存** 菜单项以保存 `图框 <title block_>`_ 更改 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:21
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block editor File menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框编辑器文件菜单"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:23
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:49
msgid ""
"At the case that the opened `title block`_ has to overwrite an existing "
"`title block`_ or it has to be saved as new `title block`_:"
msgstr ""
"如果打开的 `图框 <title block_>`_ 必须覆盖一个现有的 `图框 <title block_>`_，或者必须保存为新的 `图框 "
"<title block_>`_:"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:26
msgid ""
"Select **File > Save as** menu item to display **Save as title block** PopUP"
" window."
msgstr "选择 **文件 > 另存为** 菜单项以显示 **保存为图框** PopUP 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:31
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:57
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Save as title block PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 另存为图框 PopUP 窗口"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:33
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:59
msgid ""
"Select the `title block`_ which should be overwritten or the `parent "
"collection`_ and the name for the new `title block`_."
msgstr ""
"选择应当覆盖的 `图框 <title block_>`_ 或 `母集 <parent collection_>`_ 和新 `图框 <title "
"block_>`_ 的名称 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:34
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:40
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:60
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:79
msgid ""
"Press **OK** button to save the `title block`_ and close the PopUP window."
msgstr "按 **OK** 按钮保存 `图框 <title block_>`_ 并关闭 PopUP 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:36
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:75
msgid ""
"The `title block`_ can also be directly saved as a new file in the Hard Disk"
" directory desired:"
msgstr "`图框 <title block_>`_ 也可以作为硬盘目录中希望的新文件直接保存："

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:38
msgid ""
"Select **File > Save to a file** menu item to display the File system PopUp "
"window."
msgstr "选择 **文件 > 保存到文件** 菜单项以显示文件系统 PopUp 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:39
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:78
msgid "Select the directory and the name from the title block file."
msgstr "从图框文件中选择目录和名称。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:43
msgid "Save title block from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏中保存图框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:45
msgid ""
"Select icon |icon_save| from `toolbar`_ to save `title block`_ changes."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 选择图标 |icon_save| 以保存 `图框 <title block_>`_ 更改 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:47
msgid "icon_save"
msgstr "图标保存"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:52
msgid ""
"Select icon |icon_save_as| from `toolbar`_ to display the **Save as title "
"block** PopUP window."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 选择图标 |icon_save_as| 以显示 **保存为图框** PopUP 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:62
msgid "icon_save_as"
msgstr "图标( s)"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:66
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Tools**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 工具** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:69
msgid "Save title block using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键保存图框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:71
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:73
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + s`` to save the title block changes."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + s`` 保存图框更改 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:77
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + Shift + s`` to display the File system PopUp window."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + Shift + s`` 显示文件系统 PopUp 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/title_block_save.rst:83
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `Menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <Menu bar_>`_ 节。"
